# Student Performance Prediction

This project uses Machine Learning (Linear Regression) to predict student marks based on study hours.

## Features
- Takes study hours as input
- Predicts marks using trained model
- Displays graph visualization

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib

## How to Run
1. Install libraries
2. Run: python student_prediction.py
3. Enter study hours

